---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import "../../styles/docs.css";

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Base
	title="Live sidebar | Actual Budget Tweaks"
	description="Account groups, shortcuts, layouts and live balances in the Actual Budget Tweaks sidebar."
>
	<main class="docs center">
		<header class="docs__header stack stack--sm">
			<a href="/guides" class="docs__back">Back to guides</a>
			<h1>Live sidebar</h1>
			<p class="docs__lead">
				The Live sidebar replaces Actual's sidebar with one that has live balances, account groups,
				search and shortcuts. Turning it off brings Actual's sidebar back.
			</p>
		</header>

		<section class="docs__section">
			<h2>Add a shortcut</h2>
			<p>Click the + button above your accounts in the sidebar.</p>
			<div class="docs__stage docs__stage--card">
			<img
				src={`${base}images/guides/sidebar-add-shortcut.png`}
				width="312"
				height="300"
				alt="The top of the sidebar with the + button at the end of the shortcuts outlined"
			/>
			</div>
			<p>Then choose a shortcut from the panel beside the sidebar.</p>
			<div class="docs__stage docs__stage--card">
			<img
				src={`${base}images/guides/sidebar-shortcuts.png`}
				width="288"
				height="342"
				alt="The Add a shortcut page of the Customize sidebar panel, listing the shortcuts you can add"
			/>
			</div>
			<p>While the panel is open:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Drag a shortcut to move it.</li>
				<li>To remove a shortcut, hover over it and click the X.</li>
			</ul>
		</section>

		<section class="docs__section">
			<h2>Group your accounts</h2>
			<ol>
				<li>Open the <a href="/guides/command-palette">command palette</a> and choose <strong>Customize sidebar</strong>.</li>
				<li>Click <strong>Account groups</strong>.</li>
				<li>Add a group under On budget or Off budget.</li>
			</ol>
			<div class="docs__stage docs__stage--card">
			<img
				src={`${base}images/guides/sidebar-groups.png`}
				width="288"
				height="252"
				alt="The Account groups page of the Customize sidebar panel, with Credit Cards and Savings on budget and Retirement off budget"
			/>
			</div>
			<ul>
				<li>Drag an account onto a group in the sidebar to move it.</li>
				<li>Right-click a group to rename or remove it. Its accounts stay.</li>
				<li>Turn on Account Group Totals to show each group's balance.</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				On versions of Actual with account groups, the sidebar uses Actual's groups. On older
				versions, ABT keeps its own.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="docs__section">
			<h2>Choose a layout</h2>
			<p>
				Change the layout in the Customize sidebar panel, which also sets the density and which parts
				of the sidebar show. Split is the default.
			</p>
			<div class="docs__stage docs__stage--card">
			<img
				src={`${base}images/guides/sidebar-customize.png`}
				width="288"
				height="470"
				alt="The Customize sidebar panel with Layout and Density choices and switches for each part of the sidebar"
			/>
			</div>
			<div class="docs__stage docs__stage--pair">
				<figure>
					<img
						src={`${base}images/guides/sidebar-split.png`}
						width="312"
						height="980"
						alt="The Live sidebar in the split layout, with an icon bar beside the accounts panel"
					/>
					<figcaption>Split</figcaption>
				</figure>
				<figure>
					<img
						src={`${base}images/guides/sidebar-standard.png`}
						width="325"
						height="980"
						alt="The Live sidebar in the standard layout, with text navigation links above the accounts"
					/>
					<figcaption>Standard</figcaption>
				</figure>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="docs__section">
			<h2>Check an account</h2>
			<p>Hover over an account to see its balance trend and upcoming transactions.</p>
			<div class="docs__stage docs__stage--card">
			<img
				src={`${base}images/guides/sidebar-hover.png`}
				width="292"
				height="186"
				alt="An account's hover card with a 30-day balance chart and its cleared and uncleared amounts"
			/>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="docs__section">
			<h2>Rename or close an account</h2>
			<p>Double-click an account to rename it. Right-click it to close it.</p>
		</section>

		<section class="docs__section">
			<h2>Collapse the sidebar</h2>
			<p>Click the button at the bottom of the sidebar to collapse it to a rail of account tiles.</p>
			<p>Hover over a tile to see the account's name.</p>
			<div class="docs__stage docs__stage--rail">
				<img
					src={`${base}images/guides/sidebar-rail.png`}
					width="640"
					height="830"
					alt="The collapsed rail, with an open Credit Cards folder and closed Savings and Retirement folders shown as small grids of icons"
				/>
			</div>
			<p>Each account group becomes a folder on the rail.</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Click the folder icon above an open group to close it.</li>
				<li>Click the grid to open it again.</li>
			</ul>
		</section>
	</main>
</Base>
